# The build context is the assembled webroot. Allowlist: start by excluding
# everything, then re-admit exactly the files the image needs. A denylist here
# would eventually leak update.log, config.florun or the git checkout into a
# layer the moment someone adds a file and forgets to update this.
*
!index.html
!manifest.webmanifest
!sw.js
!nginx.conf
!Dockerfile
!css/
!css/*.css
!js/
!js/*.js
!icons/
!icons/*
